  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Systems Strengthening and HIV/AIDS Prevention, Care and Treatment under the President&apos;s Emergency Plan for AIDS Relief: Quality Improvement Solutions for Sustained Epidemic Control Project (QISSEC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Quality Improvement Solutions for Sustained Epidemic Control Project (QISSEC) is to facilitate improvements in quality across the HIV care continuum at the site level (defined as the location where persons diagnosed with HIV receive care and treatment) and within the community. The project aims to facilitate solutions for long-term change management approaches and sustainability of QA and QI activity. Activities are appropriately monitored, data and performance driven, and approaches and strategies implemented explore and introduce new and innovative solutions to achieve sustainable impact.</narrative>
  </description>
